# Expected snapshot of simple.html (plan 04 corpus). Lines must appear in
# this order and at this depth (other lines may come between); [ref]
# stands for any ref. A line starting with ! is text no line may contain.
- heading "Hello, fixtures" (h1)
- text "A short paragraph with"
- link "a link" [ref] → /nav/a.html
- text "in it."
